   </dc:creator>
   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">By scanning the QR code using a card reader, the convenient concept of contactless payment is demonstrated, showcasing NFC (Near Field Communication) technology. Simply scanning the code allows for quick and easy completion of the payment process.</rdf:li>
